This directory contains the offline PPTD exporter and patched pptd-wasm
binary from open-kimi-ppt-skill, revision
07eeaadcb04c32c9adb107eb5c8608e6be4e1008.

Upstream: https://github.com/binaryify/open-kimi-ppt-skill
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

NexaFlow adaptations:
- accepts the JSON-form PPTD projects generated by the fixed Skill without a
  YAML runtime dependency;
- rejects remote image downloads so fixed Skill execution remains offline;
- is invoked only inside the bounded OpenSandbox execution image.

